  "section_number": "2",
  "subsection_number": "(34)",
  "official_text": "\"product liability\" means the responsibility of a product manufacturer or product seller, of any product or service, to compensate for any harm caused to a consumer by such defective product manufactured or sold or by deficiency in services relating thereto;",
